a live context's facts are the facts its backend's name parses to: true
the facts bind a hardware grid exactly where the device bounds a workgroup's threads: true
grid_execution alone moves the GPU and CPU search-shaping key reads: true
workgroup_shared_placement alone moves whether a node may be kept off the device: true
seeds_untuned_default alone moves whether the seeded plan's keys are read: true
queued_timing alone moves the queued batch depth cap: true
retries_contended_window alone moves the contended-window retry: true
host_load_attributable alone moves the dispersion policy: true
blends_value_selects alone moves the inline fan-in cap's decision on a select: true
